{"id": "DeMD3q7Rwzg", "title": "Video by therishikatha", "description": "Which vahana carries Maa Durga on each night of Navratri? 🦁🐂🫏\n\nThe lion has a complaint: “Why am I doing ALL the work?” 😤😂\n\nSo here's the official Navratri vahana roster:\n\n🌙 Night 1 · Shailputri — Bull 🐂 \n🌙 Night 2 · Brahmacharini — No vahana. She walks barefoot 👣 \n🌙 Night 3 · Chandraghanta — Tigress 🐯 \n🌙 Night 4 · Kushmanda — Lion 🦁 \n🌙 Night 5 · Skandamata — Lion 🦁 \n🌙 Night 6 · Katyayani — Lion 🦁 \n🌙 Night 7 · Kalaratri — Donkey 🫏 \n🌙 Night 8 · Mahagauri — Bull 🐂 \n🌙 Night 9 · Siddhidatri — Lion + Lotus 🪷\n\nBut these aren't just rides.\n\nEach vahana represents a quality — courage, strength, patience, humility and more.\n\nAnd Brahmacharini? She has no vahana because some journeys… you have to walk yourself. 🙏\n\n📚 Want to introduce your child to these stories?\n\nNights 1–3 are part of the Rishi Katha Navadurga picture-book set: Shailputri, Brahmacharini & Chandraghanta.\n\n3 books · ₹500 · rishikatha.com \n(Link in bio)\n\nSave this for Navratri 📌 \nAnd tag the LION of your house — you know, the one who does all the work. 🦁😂\n\n#RishiKatha #Navratri #Navratri2026 #Navadurga #MaaDurga #JaiMataDi #Shailputri #Brahmacharini #Chandraghanta #Kalaratri #IndianMythology #KidsBooks #HinduMythologyForKids #ParentingIndia #IndianParents", "channel": "therishikatha", "uploader_id": "22569163881", "uploader": "Rishi Katha", "timestamp": 1791366133, "like_count": 14542, "comment_count": 58, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1639437224221935a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 38.06, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMTohiTInlGrf13p5t_MVW9RTrzTNz1Go3S8F55DT2s2upimfViMadA1H3iYg_48b45qOzHLTcGW6oZZc075RowiTZ3ewB6wgt4VNc.mp4?_nc_cat=105&_nc_oc=AdpAquzn4-DPD6tcDLvCS3dWvls56e6F0upodQXjIcNNbnqpQQcuOuWxcZhGDhsJqs2r6Lyu